\newlabel{fig:rve-geometry}{{1}{4}{The RVE: a square unit cell with a central circular hole, meshed with standard displacement-based finite elements. The outer boundary (red) carries the prescribed affine macro-strain Dirichlet condition; the remaining boundary and interior nodes, including the hole boundary, are free. The cell geometry has $D_4$ (square) symmetry, but the PANN construction in this paper does not assume or exploit it -- see Section~\ref {sec:related-klein-linden}}{figure.1}{}}
